BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wages-returns@labour-codes-library
DTSTAMP:20261104T151330Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270228
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270301
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=2;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Due: Returns under the Code on Wages
DESCRIPTION:File the returns under the Code on Wages electronically\, in 
 the Forms under the OSH Code rule 48. The OSH annual return is in Form X
 VII rule 74.\n\nWhen: The Wages Rules give no date of their own. The OSH
  annual return must reach the Inspector-cum-Facilitator on or before the
  last day of February following the end of each calendar year rule 74.\n
 \nDetails: /compliance/wages-returns/\n\nOfficial text reproduced from t
 he Gazette of India\, India Code and State Government sources. This is n
 ot legal advice\; check the source PDF before relying on any provision.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:osh-annual-return@labour-codes-library
DTSTAMP:20261104T151330Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270228
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270301
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=2;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Due: Annual return to the Inspector-cum-Facilitator
DESCRIPTION:Send an annual return in Form XVII\, covering the categories 
 of employees\, health and welfare facilities\, retrenchment or lay-offs\
 , bonus and maternity benefits\, to the Inspector-cum-Facilitator having
  jurisdiction rule 74 s. 33(d).\n\nWhen: So that it reaches the Inspecto
 r-cum-Facilitator on or before the last day of February following the en
 d of each calendar year rule 74.\n\nDetails: /compliance/osh-annual-retu
 rn/\n\nOfficial text reproduced from the Gazette of India\, India Code a
 nd State Government sources. This is not legal advice\; check the source
  PDF before relying on any provision.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:principal-employer-annual-return@labour-codes-library
DTSTAMP:20261104T151330Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270228
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270301
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=2;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Due: Principal employer's annual return on contract labour
DESCRIPTION:Submit an annual return in Form XVII (Part III) electronicall
 y to the authority and the Deputy Chief Labour Commissioner (Central) co
 ncerned rule 98(9).\n\nWhen: So that it reaches them on or before the la
 st day of February following the end of each calendar year rule 98(9).\n
 \nDetails: /compliance/principal-employer-annual-return/\n\nOfficial tex
 t reproduced from the Gazette of India\, India Code and State Government
  sources. This is not legal advice\; check the source PDF before relying
  on any provision.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:employment-information-return@labour-codes-library
DTSTAMP:20261104T151330Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270430
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270501
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Due: Employment information return
DESCRIPTION:Furnish a yearly return in Form XXVI (Employment Information 
 Return) to the Career Centre (Regional) concerned\, manually\, electroni
 cally or digitally as the State Government notifies rule 56(6).\n\nWhen:
  Within thirty days of the due date\, 31st March of the year rule 56(6).
 \n\nDetails: /compliance/employment-information-return/\n\nOfficial text
  reproduced from the Gazette of India\, India Code and State Government 
 sources. This is not legal advice\; check the source PDF before relying 
 on any provision.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ss-unified-annual-return@labour-codes-library
DTSTAMP:20261104T151330Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270228
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270301
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=2;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Due: Unified annual return
DESCRIPTION:Upload a unified annual return in Form XXIII on the web porta
 l of the Central Government in the Ministry of Labour and Employment\, w
 ith the particulars specified for the preceding year rule 53(5)(a).\n\nW
 hen: On or before the 28th or 29th day of February in each year rule 53(
 5)(a).\n\nDetails: /compliance/ss-unified-annual-return/\n\nOfficial tex
 t reproduced from the Gazette of India\, India Code and State Government
  sources. This is not legal advice\; check the source PDF before relying
  on any provision.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
