RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Due: Contractor's return in Form XVIII (half-year to 30 June)
DESCRIPTION:Send a half-yearly return in Form XVIII electronically to the
  Deputy Chief Labour Commissioner (Central) concerned rule 98(7).\n\nWhe
 n: Not later than thirty days from the close of each half year\, January
  to June and July to December rule 98(7).\n\nDetails: /compliance/contra
 ctor-half-yearly-return/\n\nOfficial text reproduced from the Gazette of
  India\, India Code and State Government sources. This is not legal advi
 ce\; check the source PDF before relying on any provision.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
